    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "REA McGee are delighted to present No. 31 Foxford Court to the market.\r\n\r\nThis well-presented two-bedroom first floor apartment offers bright and spacious accommodation extending to approximately 64 sq. m. The property comprises a welcoming entrance hallway, modern fully fitted kitchen, generous living room, two well-proportioned double bedrooms and a main bathroom.\r\n\r\nNo. 31 is presented in excellent condition throughout and benefits from a number of attractive features, including its own private door entrance, a C1 BER rating, quality flooring throughout and communal parking.\r\n\r\nResidents also have access to the well-maintained private communal gardens, providing a peaceful and pleasant outdoor space within the development.\r\n\r\nSituated in a quiet and established development, this property is ideally suited to a range of buyers, including first-time purchasers and investors. The location offers excellent convenience, with a wide selection of local amenities, shops, schools and transport links close by. The M50 and N4 road networks are also easily accessible, providing excellent connectivity to Dublin City Centre and surrounding areas."
      },
